{"id":42923,"mal_id":42923,"title":"SK∞","englishTitle":"SK8 the Infinity","title_english":"SK8 the Infinity","alternative_titles":{"synonyms":["SK Eight","Skate"],"en":"SK8 the Infinity","ja":"SK∞ エスケーエイト"},"synopsis":"High school student Reki Kyan is passionate about one thing: skateboarding. When night falls, he heads to \"S,\" an illegal underground race inside a mine where skaters compete in highly dangerous situations. After a loss that results in his skateboard being destroyed and his arm being broken, Reki is now incapable of practicing at all.\n\nWhile working, Reki runs into his new classmate, Langa Hasegawa, a half-Canadian and half-Japanese boy with no skateboarding experience whatsoever. Langa is in desperate need of money. After they both visit \"S\" when tasked by Reki's boss, they get into trouble and are forced into a bet that requires Langa to skate in a race. However, the mysterious transfer student holds a trump card that Reki is unaware of, one which might help him win the race in the most unexpected way.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]","synopsis_es":"Al estudiante de secundaria Reki Kyan le apasiona una cosa: el skate. Cuando cae la noche, se dirige a \"S\", una carrera clandestina ilegal dentro de una mina donde los patinadores compiten en situaciones de gran peligro. Después de una pérdida que resultó en la destrucción de su patineta y la fractura de su brazo, Reki ahora es incapaz de practicar en absoluto.\n\nMientras trabaja, Reki se encuentra con su nuevo compañero de clase, Langa Hasegawa, un chico mitad canadiense y mitad japonés sin ninguna experiencia en patineta. Langa necesita dinero desesperadamente. Después de que ambos visitan a \"S\" cuando el jefe de Reki les ordena, se meten en problemas y se ven obligados a hacer una apuesta que requiere que Langa patine en una carrera. Sin embargo, el misterioso estudiante transferido tiene una carta de triunfo que Reki desconoce, una que podría ayudarlo a ganar la carrera de la manera más inesperada.\n\n[Escrito por MAL Rewrite]","type":"TV","media_type":"tv","status":"finished_airing","averageEpisodeDurationSeconds":1435,"average_episode_duration":1435,"startDate":"2021-01-10","start_date":"2021-01-10","endDate":"2021-04-04","end_date":"2021-04-04","season":"winter","year":2021,"start_season":{"year":2021,"season":"winter"},"episodes":12,"num_episodes":12,"score":7.99,"mean":7.99,"numListUsers":645488,"num_list_users":645488,"genres":[{"id":3,"name":"Racing"},{"id":30,"name":"Sports"}],"studios":[{"id":4,"name":"Bones"}],"pictures":[],"backdrop_url":null,"logo_url":null,"tmdb_id":null,"tmdb_updated_at":null,"images":{"jpg":{"image_url":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1549/119195.webp","large_image_url":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1549/119195l.webp"}},"main_picture":{"medium":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1549/119195.webp","large":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1549/119195l.webp"},"trailer":{"images":{"maximum_image_url":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1549/119195l.webp"}},"broadcast":{"day":"sunday","time":"02:00","day_of_the_week":"sunday","start_time":"02:00","timezone":"Asia/Tokyo","string":"sunday 02:00"},"rank":789,"popularity":393,"rating":"pg_13","simkl_id":null,"episodes_data":[],"specials_data":[],"characters":[],"num_scoring_users":327818,"nsfw":"white","created_at":"2020-09-20T09:34:00+00:00","updated_at":"2024-10-15T22:26:00+00:00","source":"original","background":null,"related_anime":[{"node":{"id":48456,"title":"SK∞: Crazy Rock Jam","main_picture":{"medium":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1682/113409.jpg","large":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1682/113409l.jpg"}},"relation_type":"summary","relation_type_formatted":"Summary"},{"node":{"id":49363,"title":"SK∞ OVA: Extra Part","main_picture":{"medium":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1644/146433.webp","large":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1644/146433l.webp"}},"relation_type":"side_story","relatio